Subject: [PATCH] Give the legacy renderer the merged orbit scene (#21)

- Take src/Tertius.Demo/DemoScenes.cs from 90a6be90d, which adds the
  1 W airlock-lamp, so that legacy and the grid variants render the
  same scene. Evidence only: this branch is not for merge.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
